{"_id":"6915c3ac5ed105383d1cb0e3","title":"Universal Movement Recorder and Playback","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b32824f5c8d77ab709d2bbb67b3734aa7b61d59626a846790d5c7a997070c582.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1763034028723.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b32824f5c8d77ab709d2bbb67b3734aa7b61d59626a846790d5c7a997070c582.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1763034028723.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Universal-Movement-Recorder-and-Playback-65612","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":8335,"executes":658,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/110e17476062f27c938c012e73c7c00378a736d5004aadcccb41c77930adfadc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1763034028723.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1763034028723.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/110e17476062f27c938c012e73c7c00378a736d5004aadcccb41c77930adfadc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1763034028723.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1763034028723.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-11-13T11:40:28.795Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-13T11:40:28.795Z","lastBump":"2025-11-13T11:40:28.795Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.luarmor.net/files/v3/loaders/3fbbd860bc303deb61b2003362903159.lua\"))()","features":"Universal Movement Recorder (UMR)\nA smooth, lightweight movement recorder and player for Roblox that works in any game. Built with the Nozomi UI for a clean, modern interface, UMR lets you capture your character’s movement as precise keyframes and replay them with buttery-smooth interpolation.\n\nWhat it does\nRecords your character’s motion as time-stamped keyframes (position, rotation, velocity).\nReplays runs with accurate interpolation and optional camera sync.\nSaves and loads runs locally for later reuse and sharing.\nWhy it’s different\nKeyframe-based capture for smooth, stable playback.\nNozomi UI: compact, responsive, and customizable.\n“Just works” universally across games; no per-game setup required.\nCore features\nRecording/playback controls with clear UI.\nOptional camera capture during recording.\nNoclip toggle for uninterrupted replays.\nSave/load recordings as JSON.\nQuick teleport to start/end of a run.\nKeybinds\nX: Start/Stop Recording\nC: Play/Pause\nV: Toggle Loop\nTelemetry\nSends a single, loader-style “UMR-Loader-Open” event on execute.\nIncludes timestamp, place id, executor, and UMR grouping name.\nUses your site’s API and key; no spam, no extra noise.\nCompatibility\nWorks with major executors.\nOptimized for stability; avoids snapback and janky motion.\nDesigned to coexist with other scripts and overlays.\nUse cases\nSpeedrun route practice\nMovement demos/tutorials\nRepeatable pathing for testing and QA\nMontages and cinematic capture","tags":["Movement Recorder","Universal"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/fA8jDgtHg9","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6775c83f0d83e9237e3f4a20","username":"austinxyz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/db6445b8ed14fbdc43cb822fb60f0364596607b2ba515f9550c2bdf5c77a78c5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6775c83f0d83e9237e3f4a20-1762803207070.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6775c83f0d83e9237e3f4a20","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/db6445b8ed14fbdc43cb822fb60f0364596607b2ba515f9550c2bdf5c77a78c5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6775c83f0d83e9237e3f4a20-1762803207070.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-1